{"model":"gpt-4.1-nano","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Task\n\nExtract one incident from the messy notes. Preserve the source wording where it appears operationally meaningful.\n\n## Output Requirements\n\nRespond with a strict JSON object that matches this JSON Schema:\n\n{\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"x-title\": \"ArticleValidatedIncident\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"service\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"severity\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"owner\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"status\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"reportedAt\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n        \"service\",\n        \"severity\",\n        \"owner\",\n        \"status\",\n        \"reportedAt\"\n    ],\n    \"x-php-class\": \"ArticleValidatedIncident\",\n    \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"},{"role":"user","content":"Subject: Payment failed again \/ maybe already handled?\n\nNotes copied from Slack and Zendesk:\n- \"around breakfast UTC\" Priya said Billing API was throwing 502s.\n- Three checkout attempts failed before somebody wrote \"finance ops owns this unless web owns it\".\n- Alex later marked the support ticket \"looked at\", not closed.\n- Customer phrasing: \"urgent, live orders blocked, please do not call it critical unless that is the only valid high-severity value\".\n- The ops note says use status \"needs attention\" in the ticketing tool, but our incident workflow only accepts open, triaged, or closed.\n- Reference time for the report: 2026-07-11 09:10 UTC."},{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"service\":\"Billing API\",\"severity\":\"urgent\",\"owner\":\"finance ops\",\"status\":\"needs attention\",\"reportedAt\":\"2026-07-11T09:10:00Z\"}"},{"role":"user","content":"The previous response did not satisfy the structured output requirements.\n\nCorrect the response and try again.\n\n## Validation Errors\n\n[object_validation] Validation failed\n - Validation error in field 'severity' = 'urgent': The value you selected is not a valid choice.\n - Validation error in field 'status' = 'needs attention': The value you selected is not a valid choice."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"response_format":{"type":"json_object"}}